            </note>
            <note corresp="#d346-f2" n="2" xml:id="d346-f2-content">
                <p>The initialing ceremony for the Common Fund articles of agreement took place on
                    June 28. (Telegram 9018 from Geneva, June 28; National Archives, RG 59, Central
                    Foreign Policy File, D800311–0290)</p>
            </note>
